<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">vigil</ansi>

Vigil is a cleric's skill. When a camp rest finishes, the company's best
cleric keeps a vigil by the fire: each living companion with you gains
loyalty equal to the cleric's level (1 to 4), up to a loyalty of 60. It
never lowers anyone's loyalty.

Steadier loyalty matters: a companion with low loyalty may hesitate or
flee when a battle goes badly (<ansi fg="command">help morale</ansi>), and one at zero deserts
(<ansi fg="command">help alignment</ansi>). A rest spoiled by raiders brings no vigil, and a
company keeps a vigil (and forages) at most once every 15 minutes of real
time.

See also: <ansi fg="command">help camp</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help specialists</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help morale</ansi>.
